Source code in this repository is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).
Parts of it are ports of Irodori-TTS code (text normalization, rare-token splitting, inference flow).

The model release (GitHub Releases) contains converted weights and data from the works below, with their license texts:

- Irodori-TTS v4.1 Small MF (code and weights), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Aratako
  https://github.com/Aratako/Irodori-TTS  https://huggingface.co/Aratako/Irodori-TTS-v4.1-Small-MF
- ModernBERT-ja-310m (text backbone and tokenizer), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 SB Intuitions
  https://huggingface.co/sbintuitions/modernbert-ja-310m
- Semantic-DACVAE-Japanese-32dim (audio codec), MIT License, Aratako
  https://huggingface.co/Aratako/Semantic-DACVAE-Japanese-32dim
- DACVAE (code and weights the above is based on), Apache License 2.0, Meta Platforms, Inc.
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/dacvae  https://huggingface.co/facebook/dacvae-watermarked

The converter (Tools/convert) uses coreai-torch and coreai-opt (BSD 3-Clause, Apple Inc.).

The Irodori-TTS model card adds these ethical notes, reproduced here for your information:

  1. No Impersonation: Do not use this model to clone or impersonate the voice of any individual (e.g., voice actors,
     celebrities, public figures) without their explicit consent.
  2. No Misinformation: Do not use this model to generate deepfakes or synthetic speech intended to mislead others or
     spread misinformation.
  3. Voice Generation Disclaimer: When generating speech purely from text or captions without using reference audio,
     it is possible that the generated voice may coincidentally resemble that of a real person.
